### ==========================================
### 统计 Statistics
### ==========================================

# 夜班频次
# 执勤时长
# 席位时长
# 合规检查

### 夜班频次
GET http://localhost:3205/api/statistics/night-count?year=2026&month=7&userId=14

### 获取所有用户 duty-duration
GET http://localhost:3205/api/statistics/night-count?year=2026&month=5

### 获取单个用户执勤时间统计
GET http://localhost:3205/api/statistics/duty-duration?userId=4&year=2026&month=5

### 席位时长
GET http://localhost:3205/api/statistics/position-summary?year=2026&month=5

### 获取指定用户的时长
GET http://localhost:3205/api/statistics/check-duration?userId=38&year=2026&month=5






































### 执勤时长
GET http://localhost:3205/api/statistics/duty-duration??year=2026&month=5







### 检查所有人员执勤时间是否符合规范
### 返回每人数据: 是否满足条件, 24h内累计时间, 7天内累计时间
GET http://localhost:3205/api/check-duration?year=2026&month=5



### 获取单个用户夜班次数统计
GET http://localhost:3205/api/users/1/nightCount?startDate=2025-01-01&startTime=00:00:00&endDate=2025-12-31&endTime=23:59:59

### 获取席位的统计
GET http://localhost:3205/api/statistics/positions?year=2026&month=5

### ==========================================
### 日志 Log
### ==========================================

### 获取所有日志
GET http://localhost:3205/api/night-count/1?date=2026-05-01


### 获取指定月份的日志
GET http://localhost:3205/api/night-monthly/4?year=2026&month=4

