### 健康检查 Health Check
### ==========================================

### 服务器健康检查
GET http://localhost:3205/health


    
### 获取指定用户的值班统计
GET http://localhost:3205/api//users/0/dutyStatistics?startDate=2026-06-01&startTime=00:00:00&endDate=2026-06-01&endTime=00:00:01
